5 #edb/ref 17592186435178 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435183 1075 #edb/ref 17592186435179 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435183 1075 #edb/ref 17592186435180 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435183 1075 #edb/ref 17592186435181 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435183 1075 #edb/ref 17592186435182 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435183 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435183 1077 "selection" 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435183 1078 #edb/ref 17592186435180 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435183 1079 #uuid "ee942af6-92c3-5281-bece-9270696e9097" 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435184 1068 #edb/ref 17592186435183 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435184 1069 "q-163194" 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435184 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435184 1071 "![](images/21/2197dd68c567a5232ddf850b7ff8972033eb8cd0d11980baf6dc8e0a198b00a9.png)\n\nA plate occupies the region $D$ enclosed by the $x$-axis and the curves $y=x$ and $y=\\sqrt{2-x}$ in the first quadrant, as shown above. If the mass density function of $D$ is given by $\\lambda (x,y)=12y,$ find the moment of inertia of the lamina about the $x$-axis." 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435184 1072 #uuid "4a81a076-5ba8-577a-890b-aa9e7b3575b8" 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435184 1074 "For a plane lamina $D$ with mass density function $\\lambda (x,y),$ we have the following definitions:\n\n- The moment of inertia about the $x$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{x}={∬}_{D}{y}^{2}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\n- The moment of inertia about the $y$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{y}={∬}_{D}{x}^{2}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\n- The moment of inertia about the origin is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{0}={∬}_{D}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A={I}_{x}+{I}_{y}.\n$$\n\nFirst, notice that $D$ is a type II region with representation\n\n$$\nD=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,y\\le x\\le 2-{y}^{2},\\,\\,0\\le y\\le 1\\},\n$$\n\nas shown below.\n\n![](images/7a/7a4216a2b1dc3859776c6589459d687981b79b123fa3a5eea638d31529e5cd3a.png)\n\nUsing the formula for ${I}_{x},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{x} & ={∬}_{D}{y}^{2}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{y}^{2-{y}^{2}}{y}^{2}\\cdot 12y\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[{\\int }_{y}^{2-{y}^{2}}12{y}^{3}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[12x{y}^{3}]_{x=y}^{x=2-{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}12(2-{y}^{2}){y}^{3}-12{y}^{4}\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}24{y}^{3}-12{y}^{5}-12{y}^{4}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[6{y}^{4}-2{y}^{6}-\\frac{12}{5}{y}^{5}]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =6-2-\\frac{12}{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435185 1058 #edb/ref 17592186435186 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435185 1062 #uuid "0229ed29-c869-5fed-95fb-449852ec32bb" 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435185 1063 #edb/ref 17592186281611 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435186 1058 #edb/ref 17592186435188 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435186 1062 #uuid "2ca8bb5b-ad24-5ce9-83fe-edd2440737db" 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435186 1063 #edb/ref 17592186281621 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435187 1058 #edb/ref 17592186435185 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435187 1062 #uuid "35252b30-f8bd-5e44-b4f4-45a096286b2f" 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435187 1063 #edb/ref 17592186129533 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435188 1058 #edb/ref 17592186435189 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435188 1062 #uuid "8a57e415-a361-50e5-b0be-77df757bc76e" 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435188 1063 #edb/ref 17592186435184 13194139534757 17592186045417 true] [17592186435189 1062 #uuid "f7470119-a3e9-55dd-893e-db8aec